# Project environment

- Always run code in this project's conda environment.
- For this repo, use: **`conda activate caos-extract`** (or `conda run -n caos-extract`).
- Never use the global/base conda environment or a different project's env (e.g. newsai_env) when running or testing code in CAOsDataExtraction.
